---
import { urls } from '../../data/urls';
---

<section class="hero section">
	<div class="hero__shape" aria-hidden="true">
		<svg width="100%" height="96" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
			<path fill="#ffffff" d="M0,-2.13162821e-14 C16.6666667,66.6666667 33.3333333,100 50,100 C66.6666667,100 83.3333333,66.6666667 100,-2.13162821e-14 L100,100 L0,100 L0,-2.13162821e-14 Z"></path>
		</svg>
	</div>
	<div class="container grid-2">
		<div class="hero__mobile hide-desktop">
			<p class="hero__eyebrow">WELCOME TO OUR WORLD</p>
			<h1 class="hero__headline">
				Sooo… what can we do about the tech industry? Is the internet broken forever?
			</h1>
			<a href={urls.about} class="btn btn-primary">WHAT WE DO</a>
			<div class="hero__video">
				<div class="hero__video-wrap">
					<iframe
						src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9R4a_NL9prY"
						title="Girl Geek Academy video"
						allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
						allowfullscreen
						loading="lazy"></iframe>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="hero__left hide-mobile">
			<p class="hero__eyebrow">WELCOME TO OUR WORLD</p>
			<h1 class="hero__headline">
				Sooo… what can we do about the tech industry? Is the internet broken forever? the tech
				industry lacks a certain something. enough women in tech.
			</h1>
			<p>
				<strong>Only 12% of tech engineers are women, 19% of game developers are women,</strong>
				and a tiny 3% of the world's venture capital goes to women-led companies. Our mission is to
				teach one million women* technology skills by 2025. Our programs aim to support and increase
				the number of women in tech. We learn coding, game development, 3D printing, AI, machine
				learning, drones and new emerging technologies alongside our friends.
			</p>
			<a href={urls.about} class="btn btn-primary">WHAT WE DO</a>
		</div>

		<div class="hero__right">
			<h1>Girl Geek Academy aims to bring one million women and girls into technology careers by 2030</h1>
			<p>
				<strong
					>Girl Geek Academy is a social enterprise dedicated to achieving gender equality in the
					technology industry.</strong
				>
				We aim to bring one million women and girls into technology careers by 2030 through a range of
				programs in industries such as games, startups, 3D printing, design, and aviation. Our community
				is built on the foundation of friendship, learning from one another and sharing career skills
				and tech tricks. We work to tackle structural issues facing women and girls in technology by
				influencing families, corporations, government, schools, and the tech community.
			</p>

			<div class="hero__ctas hide-mobile">
				<div class="hero__cta">
					<a href="#home-classes" class="btn btn-primary">Join a CLASS</a>
					<p><strong>Holiday tech classes for women and girls.</strong></p>
				</div>
				<div class="hero__cta">
					<a href="#lets-collaborate" class="btn btn-primary">Collab with us</a>
					<p><strong>Let's work together to boost equality.</strong></p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="hero__video hide-mobile">
				<div class="hero__video-wrap">
					<iframe
						src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9R4a_NL9prY"
						title="Girl Geek Academy video"
						allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
						allowfullscreen
						loading="lazy"></iframe>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		position: relative;
		padding-bottom: 6rem;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8f9ff 0%, #ffffff 100%);
	}

	.hero__shape {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		line-height: 0;
	}

	.hero__eyebrow {
		color: var(--color-primary);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.hero__headline {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.hero__ctas {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.hero__cta p {
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.hero__video-wrap {
		position: relative;
		padding-bottom: 56.25%;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: #000;
	}

	.hero__video-wrap iframe {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 0;
	}
</style>
